hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1075","(108) Ghazwe se jo kifayat kare aur jisne ghazi ko tayyar kiya uska bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ahmad ibn Khalid al-Wahbi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shayban ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah se, Busr ibn Said se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jisne Allah ke raste me ghazi ko tayyar kiya to usne ghazwa kiya, aur jisne ghazi ke peeche uske ghar walon me bhalai ke sath khilafat ki to usne ghazwa kiya."
"1076","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shayban ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Said mawla al-Mahri se, Abu Said al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Banu Lihyan ki taraf ek lashkar bheja, Aap ne farmaya: Har do admiyon me se ek nikle, aur ajr dono ke darmiyan hai."
